# docbook-xml
### The DTD of DocBook XML 4.5, a tool of the build machine (lfs/docbook-xml:native): the manual pages
### of lfs/systemd, lfs/polkit and the xmlto of lfs/xmlto:native are DocBook documents that xsltproc
### reads with their DTD, --nonet, through the XML catalog of lfs/libxml2:native
PKG_VER=4.5
PKG_URL="https://archive.docbook.org/xml/${PKG_VER}/docbook-xml-${PKG_VER}.zip"
PKG_DEPS="lfs/libxml2:native"
BUILD_PROCESS=custom
